      "message": "Why does db845 need to be changed? Will this cause a build-break for other partners?\n\nGenerally you should never change symbol lists other than your own. Please refactor the code (in a separate patch) so other partners don\u0027t require tegra symbols.\n\nAlso, if there is a reason to change symbol lists or ABI, those need to be in a separate patch.",
